<title>UK: Norcros appoints new finance director.</title>
<headline>Norcros appoints new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norcros Plc said it appointed its former group finanacial controller, Nicholas Kelsall, group finance director.  </p>
<p>Kelsall replaces Gavin Morris who resigned in March to take up the position of finance director at Alfred McAlpine Plc, Norcross said.</p>
